    {
      "item": "Guideline severity",
      "reason": "The document says the credit box contains guidelines and is subject to lender discretion, but the tables are presented as tier thresholds. I modeled the tier thresholds and stated restrictions as hard eligibility rules.",
      "suggestion": "Confirm whether these should be hard rules for automated tiering or soft guidance only."
    },
    {
      "item": "Standard vs. corp-only program selection",
      "reason": "The document provides a separate 'If Corp only' table. I assumed the standard and no-PayNet tables are for non-corp-only requests to avoid overlap with the corp-only table.",
      "suggestion": "Confirm whether corp-only requests should be evaluated only against the corp-only table."
    },
    {
      "item": "Corp-only PayNet availability",
      "reason": "The corp-only table includes PayNet thresholds but does not explicitly say 'has PayNet' is required. I modeled PayNet score thresholds but did not add a separate has_paynet condition.",
      "suggestion": "Confirm whether corp-only applications with no PayNet score are ineligible or should use another table."
    },
    {
